window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-32303e3969d06bdd"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"prepare-an-initiative-health-update\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">准备战略计划进展简报</h1> <p>将持续更新的计划信息整理成清晰的领导层简报。</p> <p>提供跟踪表、计划文档、KPI 变化、以往简报、负责人笔记、决策日志和相关方背景，让 ChatGPT 总结进展、变化、阻碍、风险、决策和过时事项。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>每周或每月更新战略计划进展。</li> <li>需要在一次运营审阅中汇总进展、变化、阻碍和决策的工作。</li> <li>希望明确标出过时事项和缺失负责人背景的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>读取跟踪表、计划文档、以往简报和决策日志。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>审阅相关方讨论、阻碍和负责人更新。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>核验 KPI 变化和进度数据。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>起草领导层更新，以及适合发给相关方的后续版本。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>准备战略计划进展更新</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请准备 [weekly or monthly] 的 [initiative] 战略计划进展更新。\n\n使用我提供的项目跟踪表、计划文档、KPI 变化、以往简报、负责人笔记、决策日志、相关方讨论和其他背景信息。请起草：\n- 进展和重要变化\n- 风险和阻碍\n- 需要作出的决策\n- 后续行动和负责人\n- 需要跟进的过时事项\n\n所有重要陈述都应以来源材料为依据。区分已确认状态和推断，不要编辑跟踪表。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-business-operations-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：业务运营团队（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/meeting-prep-briefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">准备会议简报（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"make-the-operating-cadence-comparable\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">让不同周期的进展可以比较</h2> <p>定期更新计划进展时，最好每次都使用相同结构。向 ChatGPT 提供当前跟踪表、上一期简报、KPI 变化、决策日志、负责人笔记和相关方背景，便于识别变化和过时事项。</p> <ol> <li>说明报告周期、计划、受众和状态用词。</li> <li>附上跟踪表、计划文档、KPI 变化、以往简报和决策日志。</li> <li>请 ChatGPT 对照负责人和相关方背景核对当前状态。</li> <li>运行起始提示词，审阅进展、风险、阻碍、决策和后续行动。</li> <li>分享更新前，与计划负责人核实过时事项及其负责人。</li> </ol> <p>领导层版本用于支持决策，相关方版本用于后续跟进。两者都应对应同一份源记录，避免重点不同演变成事实不一致。</p> <p><a id=\"compare-two-reporting-periods\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">对比两个报告周期</h2> <p>请 ChatGPT 只列出变化，以加快运营审阅。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Compare this initiative update with the previous period.\n\nReturn only:\n\n- progress that changed\n- new or worsening risks\n- blockers that cleared or remain\n- decisions added or resolved\n- next actions with changed owners or dates\n- stale items that still need follow-up\n\nKeep claims source-backed and flag status that cannot be confirmed.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">将这份项目举措进展更新与上一期比较。\n\n只返回：\n\n- 发生变化的进展\n- 新增或恶化的风险\n- 已解除或仍然存在的阻碍\n- 新增或已解决的决策事项\n- 负责人或日期发生变化的后续行动\n- 已过时但仍需跟进的事项\n\n所有说法都要有来源支持，并标出无法确认的状态。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"prepare-an-initiative-health-update\">Prepare an initiative health update</h1> <p>Turn recurring initiative context into a clear leadership readout.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT the tracker, initiative docs, KPI changes, prior briefs, owner notes, decision log, and stakeholder context, then ask it to summarize progress, deltas, blockers, risks, decisions, and stale items.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Weekly or monthly updates for a strategic initiative.</li> <li>Operating reviews that need progress, deltas, blockers, and decisions in one place.</li> <li>Teams that want stale items and missing owner context called out explicitly.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read trackers, initiative docs, prior briefs, and decision logs.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Review stakeholder discussion, blockers, and owner updates.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Validate KPI changes and progress data.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Draft a leadership update and a stakeholder-ready follow-up version.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Prepare the initiative update</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Prepare the [weekly or monthly] strategic initiative update for [initiative].\n\nUse the project tracker, initiative docs, KPI changes, prior briefs, owner notes, decision log, stakeholder threads, and related context I provide. Draft:\n\n- progress and material deltas\n- risks and blockers\n- decisions needed\n- next actions and owners\n- stale items to chase\n\nKeep material claims grounded in the source context. Separate confirmed status from inference and do not edit the tracker.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-business-operations-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Business operations teams (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/meeting-prep-briefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prepare meeting briefs (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"make-the-operating-cadence-comparable\">Make the operating cadence comparable</h2> <p>Recurring initiative updates work best when each version uses the same structure. Give ChatGPT the current tracker, prior brief, KPI changes, decision log, owner notes, and stakeholder context so it can make deltas and stale items easy to spot.</p> <ol> <li>Define the reporting period, initiative, audience, and status vocabulary.</li> <li>Attach the tracker, initiative documents, KPI changes, prior briefs, and decision log.</li> <li>Ask ChatGPT to reconcile current status with owner and stakeholder context.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and review progress, risks, blockers, decisions, and next actions.</li> <li>Check stale items and owners with the initiative lead before sharing the update.</li> </ol> <p>Use a leadership version for decisions and a stakeholder version for follow-ups. Keep both tied to the same source record so differences in emphasis do not become differences in fact.</p> <h2 id=\"compare-two-reporting-periods\">Compare two reporting periods</h2> <p>Ask ChatGPT to produce a delta-only view for a faster operating review.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Compare this initiative update with the previous period.\n\nReturn only:\n\n- progress that changed\n- new or worsening risks\n- blockers that cleared or remain\n- decisions added or resolved\n- next actions with changed owners or dates\n- stale items that still need follow-up\n\nKeep claims source-backed and flag status that cannot be confirmed.\n</code></pre>"};
